For every BetterInstincts gameplay task, read `AGENTS.md`,
`docs/AGENT_OPERATING_RULES.md`, `docs/NATIVE_GAMEPLAY_ARCHITECTURE.md`
and `contracts/native-gameplay-authority.v1.json` before proposing an
implementation. P00: preserve the native mechanism philosophy. P01: obey
`python -m scripts.check_native_gameplay_authority` plus PR base-ref gate,
then existing safety and ontology preflight. Add
`contracts/native-gameplay-decisions/<feature>.v1.json` for any changed
`betterinstincts/*.py`, `tuning/` or `native_mod/` file.

**Do not implement Sim autonomy by mouse/keyboard/HUD queue automation.**
Use patch-proven EA XML scoring/tests or verified embedded in-game Python
mechanics, event-driven, opt-in and reversible. Host vision and GUI input
remain bounded disposable test tools only; they do not certify game behavior.
Never invent EA hook names or game version, cancel player's queue, interfere
with beneficial social/fun, modify user saves, disable keyboard/Bluetooth
or bypass local handoff protection. An offline policy is only a recommendation,
not an installed mod.

Native integration issue: #171. Current Horizon live gate: BI-002.
If exact EA evidence is absent, record `LOCAL_EA_EVIDENCE_REQUIRED`
and do the safe repo work without substituting a desktop clicker.
